    "steam_appid": 2756970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756970/extras/8c3c385f5f25ad76116c59d456be350d.avif?t=1737272007\" width=422 height=324 /></span><br><br>In Cave Escape you are perpetually trying to escape the dangers looming within the darkness of the caves you have found yourself in. Players find themselves in a maze-like dark cave with only a torch in-hand to illuminate their path. The goal is to find the exit on each level within the given timeframe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural maze generation</h2>Each level is procedurally generated using a seed value. This means each level can be replied while allowing for a huge number of levels for replayability.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your light will run out - be quick!</h2>Your torch has limited fuel and is fading fast. Escape before it extinguishes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anxiety</h2>As the player's light diminishes, their anxiety level increases. This gives them a speed boost at the expense of precision.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756970/extras/8c3c385f5f25ad76116c59d456be350d.avif?t=1737272007\" width=422 height=324 /></span><br><br>In Cave Escape you are perpetually trying to escape the dangers looming within the darkness of the caves you have found yourself in. Players find themselves in a maze-like dark cave with only a torch in-hand to illuminate their path. The goal is to find the exit on each level within the given timeframe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural maze generation</h2>Each level is procedurally generated using a seed value. This means each level can be replied while allowing for a huge number of levels for replayability.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your light will run out - be quick!</h2>Your torch has limited fuel and is fading fast. Escape before it extinguishes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anxiety</h2>As the player's light diminishes, their anxiety level increases. This gives them a speed boost at the expense of precision.",
    "short_description": "An indie 2D top-down maze escape puzzler. Get out of each maze before your light runs out and try get the highscore for each level!",
